// Installed name: TEST - Jelly Declared Selector; purpose: test the scope error separately from indexed extraction; role: diagnostic.
// Specification revision: 1; interface version: 1.0.
// Input: Ignored; fixed two-Text List. Dependencies: None. No required fields or defaults.
// Output: Two Quick Look previews: Fri1-TestComposer-TestPiece.pdf, then ^Fri[0-9]+-. No explicit return contract.
// Direct/called: Same interactive previews; no files, network, provider access or forScore writes. Permissions: None.
// Target: Jellycuts 2026.6.4 / iPadOS 26.6; bundled compiler unknown. Local: Open-Jellycore e1ec31c / Swift 6.4.1.
